{"id":"664365","name":"自制凉粉","author":"红袖添香v","authorId":"11598100","desc":"","cover":"images/664365/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豌豆淀粉","amount":"1纸杯"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"7纸杯"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"做凉粉最重要的是比例搭配，1杯豌豆粉，7杯水。","img":"images/664365/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把豌豆粉倒盆中。","img":"images/664365/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"先倒入其中1杯水搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664365/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把其余6杯水倒入锅中烧开。","img":"images/664365/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"开水倒入豌豆粉中搅拌均匀。","img":"images/664365/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"换入一个瓷碗中。","img":"images/664365/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放锅中上汽蒸30分钟。","img":"images/664365/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蒸好后放凉。","img":"images/664365/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒扣出来。","img":"images/664365/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切块装盘。","img":"images/664365/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"砸好的蒜泥中倒入盐、酱油、醋。","img":"images/664365/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再加入一勺麻汁拌匀。","img":"images/664365/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"将麻汁浇到凉粉上就可以开吃了！夏天开胃凉拌菜，好吃简单又省钱！","img":"images/664365/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}